  "solution": {
    "text": "Slope of tangent at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></msub></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So equation tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />for point of intersection with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br />ordinate of required point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p>"
